  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-17T22:42:48.293Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the current rumor of worlds being soon being moderated by size, it would be a terrible to deny something because ofdraconian size restrictions, a lot of good worlds would be denied even if they are staples of the community and a lot of those vrchat-only experiences would be denied.\n\nWorlds already have their size available on the session select screen AND on the load world screen, an improvement world be to classify these worlds instead of denying by size\n\nWorld Class\n:Tiny(if below 20mb)= blue\nSmoll (up to 50mb)=teal\nMedium (up to 100mb) = green\nLarge (up to 150mb) = orange\nGrande (200+) = red\n\nOther features could also be\n:worlds have a recommended download speed (example: Recommened 5mbps+, 50mbps+\n:download estimation (example:estimated 2:15  @12.6mbps) \n\nWith the growing number of users, it would be terrible if they where never able to experience the creativity of this community due to these restrictions",
